er/id #uuid "1f2ea1a6-10d2-55f9-9e1a-8b79ec9790f2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{11}{5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-2e253573-b142-5acf-8a8d-328d4bb8251e" :answer/id #uuid "2e253573-b142-5acf-8a8d-328d4bb8251e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e2462a8d-9dc3-538f-b979-1fc867a6f9a7" :answer/id #uuid "e2462a8d-9dc3-538f-b979-1fc867a6f9a7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2}{5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-9bf7b9c3-f8f3-5c91-8b55-0252e40b80c9" :answer/id #uuid "9bf7b9c3-f8f3-5c91-8b55-0252e40b80c9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186087688 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-cb6eb9c0-dc4b-52b4-82f6-8cb252573f49"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-cb6eb9c0-dc4b-52b4-82f6-8cb252573f49" :question/id #uuid "cb6eb9c0-dc4b-52b4-82f6-8cb252573f49" :question/math-academy-id "q-44497" :question/problem "For what value of $k$ are the lines $3x+4y=8$ and $kx+4y=-20$ parallel?" :question/worked-solution "For two lines to be parallel, they must have the same slope.\n\n- To find the slope of the line $3x+4y=8,$ we convert to slope-intercept form, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3x+4y & =8 \\\\ 4y & =-3x+8 \\\\ y & =-\\frac{3}{4}x+2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIn slope-intercept form, the slope is the $x$-coefficient. So, the slope is $-\\frac{3}{4}.$\n\n- To find the slope of the line $kx+4y=-20,$ we convert to slope-intercept form, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}kx+4y & =-20 \\\\ 4y & =-kx-20 \\\\ y & =-\\frac{k}{4}x-5\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIn slope-intercept form, the slope is the $x$-coefficient. So, the slope is $-\\frac{k}{4}.$\n\nSince the slopes of the two lines must be equal, we must have $-\\frac{k}{4}=-\\frac{3}{4}.$ We solve for $k:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-\\frac{k}{4} & =-\\frac{3}{4} \\\\ \\frac{k}{4} & =\\frac{3}{4} \\\\ k & =3\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-d4a445c9-d381-5c2e-b303-52cf74b14cc4"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-d4a445c9-d381-5c2e-b303-52cf74b14cc4" :answer-field/id #uuid "d4a445c9-d381-5c2e-b303-52cf74b14cc4" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-6ffae9ff-6b6e-5388-bf97-8dc654e42f0f" :answer-field/choices ["answer-f78b21b4-650c-520d-9683-83fa3a54718f" "answer-5d1a2852-f517-5d90-b7be-d24e175f9b41" "answer-6ffae9ff-6b6e-5388-bf97-8dc654e42f0f" "answer-f2eaee78-411a-511b-8fbf-db72b68e0281" "answer-e584ece9-087d-5e7b-b826-0e85175c9c44"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-f78b21b4-650c-520d-9683-83fa3a54718f" :answer/id #uuid "f78b21b4-650c-520d-9683-83fa3a54718f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-5d1a2852-f517-5d90-b7be-d24e175f9b41" :answer/id #uuid "5d1a2852-f517-5d90-b7be-d24e175f9b41" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-6ffae9ff-6b6e-5388-bf97-8dc654e42f0f" :answer/id #uuid "6ffae9ff-6b6e-5388-bf97-8dc654e42f0f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-f2eaee78-411a-511b-8fbf-db72b68e0281" :answer/id #uuid "f2eaee78-411a-511b-8fbf-db72b68e0281" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e584ece9-087d-5e7b-b826-0e85175c9c44" :answer/id #uuid "e584ece9-087d-5e7b-b826-0e85175c9c44" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186111283 :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186115648 :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "activity-b86f0b6e-2a2b-5d65-aeaf-e84e1b6362ed" :activity/id #uuid "b86f0b6