 by\n\n$$\n{a}^{3}+{b}^{3}=(a+b)({a}^{2}-ab+{b}^{2}).\n$$\n\nNotice that all of the terms have a common factor of $3.$ To simplify the computation, we can factor out the $3,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n81{n}^{3}+24=3(27{n}^{3}+8)\n$$\n\nThe expression in parentheses can be written as a sum of cubes:\n\n$$\n3(27{n}^{3}+8)=3((3n)^{3}+{2}^{3})\n$$\n\nNow, we factor the expression in parentheses using the sum of cubes formula:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}81{n}^{3}+24 & =3((3n)^{3}+{2}^{3}) \\\\  & =3(3n+2)((3n)^{2}-3n\\cdot 2+{2}^{2}) \\\\  & =3(3n+2)(9{n}^{2}-6n+4)\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-d4e7a715-54af-5638-b9d3-7f1eeed3070d"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-d4e7a715-54af-5638-b9d3-7f1eeed3070d" :answer-field/id #uuid "d4e7a715-54af-5638-b9d3-7f1eeed3070d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-103226af-902e-5a7b-8fa5-0f61ab93b621" :answer-field/choices ["answer-ae8d767d-1181-5a31-be8e-9897b6f24b62" "answer-101ee2de-8b73-5ce0-ac17-7ff2a131872d" "answer-d2879924-8f25-5ed6-a051-33e68b0dec4e" "answer-103226af-902e-5a7b-8fa5-0f61ab93b621" "answer-de0604d8-af59-5a9b-9c7f-e0f299b8a32b"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ae8d767d-1181-5a31-be8e-9897b6f24b62" :answer/id #uuid "ae8d767d-1181-5a31-be8e-9897b6f24b62" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(3n+1)(3{n}^{2}-6n+4)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-101ee2de-8b73-5ce0-ac17-7ff2a131872d" :answer/id #uuid "101ee2de-8b73-5ce0-ac17-7ff2a131872d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(n+2)(9{n}^{2}+6n+4)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d2879924-8f25-5ed6-a051-33e68b0dec4e" :answer/id #uuid "d2879924-8f25-5ed6-a051-33e68b0dec4e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3(3n+2)(3{n}^{2}-6n+8)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-103226af-902e-5a7b-8fa5-0f61ab93b621" :answer/id #uuid "103226af-902e-5a7b-8fa5-0f61ab93b621" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3(3n+2)(9{n}^{2}-6n+4)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-de0604d8-af59-5a9b-9c7f-e0f299b8a32b" :answer/id #uuid "de0604d8-af59-5a9b-9c7f-e0f299b8a32b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3(3n-1)(9{n}^{2}+6n+8)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186068746 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-f995ab76-e781-54a1-b26b-a28e8f4d92d3"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-f995ab76-e781-54a1-b26b-a28e8f4d92d3" :question/id #uuid "f995ab76-e781-54a1-b26b-a28e8f4d92d3" :question/math-academy-id "q-37670" :question/problem "Factor the expression $\\frac{{x}^{3}}{8}-\\frac{{z}^{6}}{125}.$" :question/worked-solution "The difference of cubes formula is given by\n\n$$\n{a}^{3}-{b}^{3}=(a-b)({a}^{2}+ab+{b}^{2}).\n$$\n\nNotice that we can write our expression as a difference of cubes:\n\n$$\n\\frac{{x}^{3}}{8}-\\frac{{z}^{6}}{125}={(\\frac{x}{2})}^{3}-{(\\frac{{z}^{2}}{5})}^{3}\n$$\n\nNow, we factor the given expression using the difference of cubes formula:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{x}^{3}}{8}-\\frac{{z}^{6}}{125} & ={(\\frac{x}{2})}^{3}-{(\\frac{{z}^{2}}{5})}^{3} \\\\  & =(\\frac{x}{2}-\\frac{{z}^{2}}{5})({(\\frac{x}{2})}^{2}+\\frac{x}{2}\\cdot \\frac{{z}^{2}}{5}+{(\\frac{{z}^{2}}{5})}^{2}) \\\\  & =(\\frac{x}{2}-\\frac{{z}^{2}}{5})(\\frac{{x}^{2}}{4}+\\frac{x{z}^{2}}{10}+\\frac{{z}^{4}}{25})\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-3778dcd4-e5bf-5ca6-87ec-1602ea82538b"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-3778dcd4-e5bf-5ca6-87ec-1602ea82538b" :answer-field/id #uuid "3778dcd4-e5bf-5ca6-87ec-1602ea82538b" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-21ff553e-31bf-5462-bc96-18edbe3a3704" :answer-field/choices ["answer-f5c141ba-a2f5-57ec-aefe-7eba43f333e0" "answer-d71f1d20-7755-56b8-8c54-b7d4b6442d20" "answer-21ff553e-31bf-5462-bc96-18edbe3a3704" "answer-8a828d43-3631-5741-b430-d22059e6ceab" "answer-2c70c2c2-3b0e-51d8-9462-0a96a3819823"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-f5c141ba-a2f5-57ec-aefe-7eba43f333e0" :answer/id #uuid "f5c141ba-a2f5-57ec-aefe-7eba43f333e0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(\\frac{x}{2}+\\frac{{z}^{2}}{5})(\\frac{{x}^{2}}{4}-\\frac{x{z}^{2}}{10}+\\frac{{z}^{4}}{5})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d71f1d20-7755-56b8-8c54-b7d4b6442d20" :answer/id #uuid "d71f1d20-7755-56b8-8c54-b7d4b6442d20" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(\\frac{x}{2}-\\frac{{z}^{2}}{5})(\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}+\\frac{xz}{5}+\\frac{{z}^{4}}{25})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-21ff553e-31bf-5462-bc96-18edbe3a3704" :answer/id #uuid "21ff553e-31bf-5462-bc96-18edbe3a3704" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(\\frac{x}{2}-\\frac{{z}^{2}}{5})(\\frac{{x}^{2}}{4}+\\frac{x{z}^{2}}{10}+\\frac{{z}^{4}}{25})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-8a828d43-3631-5741-b430-d22059e6ceab" :answer/id #uuid "8a828d43-3631-5741-b430-d22059e6ceab" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(\\frac{x}{4}-\\frac{{z}^{2}}{10})(\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}+\\frac{x{z}^{2}}{5}+\\frac{{z}^{4}}{25})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-2c70c2c2-3b0e-51d8-9462-0a96a3819823" :answer/id #uuid "2c70c2c2-3b0e-51d8-9462-0a96a3819823" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(\\frac{x}{6}-\\frac{{z}^{2}}{5})(\\frac{{x}^{2}}{6}+\\frac{x{z}^{2}}{5}+\\frac{{z}^{4}}{5})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186069489 :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "activity-ee5d6eb8-d66a-5590-9825-8b9d8e7d7856" :activity/id #uuid "ee5d6eb8-d66a-5590-9825-8b9d8e7d7856" :activity/title "Factoring Sums and Differences of Cubes" :activity/type :activity.type/review :activity/scope 17592186049153 :activity/course 17592186046647 :activity/steps ["step-1681c3be-f584-53ab-