h $y=|x|$ by $a$ units right.\n\nThe function $y=|x+1|$ has $a=-1.$ Therefore, it is a horizontal translation of the absolute value graph $y=|x|$ by $1$ unit left.\n\n![](images/38/38532ccdd10c7a60f26fdf35c837376af799d7b024370e8b223cd61b7b18eb9d.png)\n\nLooking at the graph, we can see that the coordinates of the minimum point are $(-1,0).$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-a0a5060b-5648-5c20-ac0c-e7491147f963"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-a0a5060b-5648-5c20-ac0c-e7491147f963" :answer-field/id #uuid "a0a5060b-5648-5c20-ac0c-e7491147f963" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-3ba1fb6c-8327-51bf-8fb0-05e23abf8c83" :answer-field/choices ["answer-3ba1fb6c-8327-51bf-8fb0-05e23abf8c83" "answer-23d06b4f-bc10-59f4-bad3-9be438d8e2e4" "answer-a4336403-9070-5be9-84ed-ebf6940c61a2" "answer-4cf6e7fe-b201-5c9d-a8a4-bd5f53457d4b" "answer-e950df02-b773-5199-bf04-fc99be23ac4a"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-3ba1fb6c-8327-51bf-8fb0-05e23abf8c83" :answer/id #uuid "3ba1fb6c-8327-51bf-8fb0-05e23abf8c83" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(-1,0)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-23d06b4f-bc10-59f4-bad3-9be438d8e2e4" :answer/id #uuid "23d06b4f-bc10-59f4-bad3-9be438d8e2e4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(0,-1)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a4336403-9070-5be9-84ed-ebf6940c61a2" :answer/id #uuid "a4336403-9070-5be9-84ed-ebf6940c61a2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(0,1)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-4cf6e7fe-b201-5c9d-a8a4-bd5f53457d4b" :answer/id #uuid "4cf6e7fe-b201-5c9d-a8a4-bd5f53457d4b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(1,0)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e950df02-b773-5199-bf04-fc99be23ac4a" :answer/id #uuid "e950df02-b773-5199-bf04-fc99be23ac4a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(1,1)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-2b65f25b-10a0-5e3f-8752-11a285fdf596" :question/id #uuid "2b65f25b-10a0-5e3f-8752-11a285fdf596" :question/math-academy-id "q-222360" :question/problem "The minimum value of the function $y=|x+3|+2$ is $y=${{field-1}}." :question/worked-solution "Remember that $y=|x-h|+k$ is a vertical translation of the absolute value graph $y=|x|$ by $h$ units right and $k$ units up.\n\nThe function $y=|x+3|+2$ has $h=-3$ and $k=2.$ Therefore, it is a translation of the absolute value graph $y=|x|$ by $3$ units *left* and $2$ units *up*.\n\n![](images/81/81bace946b2fb425efa7fd7c54eb53ec353be5d9ef1516d9cf24e2c13656a60b.png)\n\nLooking at the graph, we can see that the minimum value of $y$ is $2.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-aecd1abd-2502-5a3e-aece-0d12a409100b"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-aecd1abd-2502-5a3e-aece-0d12a409100b" :answer-field/id #uuid "aecd1abd-2502-5a3e-aece-0d12a409100b" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-ee5d6999-dacf-585b-9763-55851b2e5a28" :answer-field/choices ["answer-ee5d6999-dacf-585b-9763-55851b2e5a28"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ee5d6999-dacf-585b-9763-55851b2e5a28" :answer/id #uuid "ee5d6999-dacf-585b-9763-55851b2e5a28" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "activity-b4da87d0-f5a5-50ee-a9f0-c6cb2fb5fc32" :activity/id #uuid "b4da87d0-f5a5-50ee-a9f0-c6cb2fb5fc32" :activity/title "Absolute Value Graphs" :activity/type :activity.type/review :activity/scope 17592186049474 :activity/course 17592186046647 :activity/steps ["step-a2af62b9-442c-506b-9cce-b6a9e9270c22" "step-878cfbc6-5471-58e8-915b-20a46b57e956" "step-9437c58f-f80b-51f5-a33f-6de7c5ebdc3a" "step-9272e140-eade-50e0-aa74-a463e9e7aca4" "step-c6cb8059-d840-5375-a89b-c4dc968b16b1"] :activity/first-step "step-a2af62b9-442c-506b-9cce-b6a